  "definition": "Adjustments to Treatment Plant Classification",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-08-19",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 502) #9410, eff 3-12-09); ss by #12363, eff 8-19-17 (formerly Env-Dw 502.13)",
